\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Around the throne of God in heaven
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj Thousands of children stand ,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 Children whose sins are all forgiven,
\par A holy, happy band,
\par  Singing, Glory, glory, glory
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. What brought them to that world above
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0  That heaven so bright and fair
\par Where all is peace and joy and love
\par How came those children there
\par Singing, Glory, glory, glory
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.   Because the Saviour shed His bold
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0\qj  To wash away their sin
\par Bathed in that pure and precious flood
\par Behold them white and clean
\par Singing, Glory, glory, glory
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  On earth they sought the Saviour's grace
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0  On earth they loved His Name
\par  So now they see His blessed face
\par  And stand before the Lamb
\par \pard       Singing, Glory, glory, glory\f1 
